  - Id: 16
    Name: Bubbla
    Description: "They swim in small pods but can also be found by themselves. The
      bubble on their heads helps them attract mates, but it also can be easily broken,
      so they are careful to avoid danger. They are relatively friendly and will
      follow the boat, but as soon as the boat goes near them, they will scatter.
      Even though they are in the small category, they are among the largest \u201Csmall\u201D
      fish."
    Type: 0
    Habitat: 0
    CatchTier: 0
    Attractor: 1
