  - Id: 21
    Name: Zuko
    Description: Quick moving aggressive fish that are difficult to hook. They like
      to hide among the rocks and other tight safe places, although the smell of
      meat catches their attention.
    Type: 0
    Habitat: 0
    CatchTier: 0
    Attractor: 1
    Rarity: 0
    SpecialLootId: 0
    Difficulty: 1
    WeightClassMultiplier: 2
    Experience: 10
    MovementDescription: Jetting motions, where they will move forward and stop,
      and then move forward again which may be a challenge to deal with among the
      waves.
