  - Id: 56
    Name: Lumaca
    Description: "A nearly brainless creature that sees all. With its many eyes,
      it does not miss much, making it a bit more elusive than other fish. It\u2019s
      too large to be around the rocks and doesn\u2019t hunt any fish, but prefers
      plant life and krill to survive."
    Type: 1
    Habitat: 0
    CatchTier: 0
    Attractor: 0
    Rarity: 0
    SpecialLootId: 0
    Difficulty: 1
    WeightClassMultiplier: 1.8
    Experience: 10
    MovementDescription: Persistent, and energetic, they will swim away from the
      boat every chance they get which makes bringing them in hard. They also prefer
      to jump and dive.
