  - Id: 106
    Name: Roroaata
    Description: "Roroaata circle in the depths, only surfacing to devour prey that
      catch their interest. Oftentimes, you will only glimpse a massive shadow. It\u2019s
      true appearance is revealed when it uses its immense strength to jump above
      the waves to catch it\u2019s prey."
    Type: 2
    Habitat: 0
    CatchTier: 0
    Attractor: 2
    Rarity: 0
    SpecialLootId: 0
    Difficulty: 1
    WeightClassMultiplier: 1.6
    Experience: 10
    MovementDescription: It might feel like you are reeling in a living rock.. Its
      movements are slow but it seems to never tire out.
    CatchMissionCount1: 5
    CatchMissionCount2: 10
    CatchMissionCount3: 50
    BoonBonus: 3
    Weight: 1
