  - Id: 111
    Name: Soltongfisk
    Description: The Soltongfisk is probably the closest in size to a kaiju without
      being classified as one, and directly competes with the large sharks in the
      reefs on the rare occasion that they meet as they compete over the depth.
    Type: 2
    Habitat: 0
    CatchTier: 0
    Attractor: 1
    Rarity: 0
    SpecialLootId: 0
    Difficulty: 1
    WeightClassMultiplier: 1.6
    Experience: 10
    MovementDescription: "Sharp and fast, this power house will use its head to its
      advantage to throw you off the line, and break stuff in its way in the effort
      to hit you with debris. It may even shoot spikes at you\u2026"
    CatchMissionCount1: 5
    CatchMissionCount2: 10
